# Thin Shell — Capability bag consolidation map

Phase **4bv** freezes the **as-built fine-grained** `WorkspacePluginCapabilities` bag and the optional **coarse-domain** fold sketch from plan §2.3 / §2.3.1.

**No SDK type fold in this slice.** Consolidation is doc-only until Architect scopes a code migration.

## Why fine-grained stays

Wave 3–4 deleted binders one surface at a time. Matching one binder → one capability kept PRs reversible and architecture tests cheap. Plan §2.3’s coarse domains (`settings`, `forms`, `navigation`, …) remain a **valid future** grouping — not a defect in the live bag.

## As-built inventory (locked)

Slots on `WorkspacePluginCapabilities` (SDK) — order mirrors the type:

