| --- | --- | --- |
| `wizardHost` | hooks + `ensureReady` | Dual with top-level until fully migrated |
| `hostProbe` | A (data) | Generic `/workspace-host-probe` |
| `draftShell` | A (pure helpers) | Identity + draft helpers |
| `createChrome` | B | Map-keyed UI surface |
| `flatEditChrome` | B | Map-keyed UI surface |
| `createView` | B | Map-keyed UI surface |
| `flatEditForm` | B | Map-keyed UI surface |
| `flatEditPage` | B | Map-keyed UI surface |
